---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Pakistan Finance Calculators"
  description="About Pakistan Finance Calculators: free, private calculators for salary tax, EMI, Zakat, currency, gold, percentage, age, and marla conversion."
  slug="/about/"
>
  <div class="container prose-narrow u-pt-40">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Pakistan Finance Calculators is a small set of free calculators built
      for people in Pakistan: salary and income tax, loan EMI, Zakat,
      currency conversion, gold prices, percentages, age, and land-area
      conversion between marla, kanal, and square feet.
    </p>
    <h2>How figures are sourced</h2>
    <p>
      Tax slabs and conversion factors are stored in config files with an
      effective date and a source citation. Currency and gold rates come
      from named providers, fetched once a day by a same-origin service,
      and are always shown with their last-updated time. A rate that is
      no longer current is labelled stale; if no rate is available, the
      tool says so instead of showing a guessed figure.
    </p>
    <p>
      The FBR slabs are verified against the Finance Act 2026 Gazette,
      and the marla factors are sourced: 272.25 sq ft per marla from the
      Capital Development Authority's 2023 Regulation (S.R.O. 886(I)/2023),
      and 225 sq ft per marla from DHA Lahore's Construction &amp;
      Development Regulations 2014. The affected pages show their
      sources.
    </p>
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      All calculations run in your browser. No account is needed, no
      input is sent to a server for calculation, and no input is stored,
      logged, or put in a URL. See the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Feedback</h2>
    <p>
      If a result looks wrong, please tell us through the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> — include the inputs you used
      and what you expected, and never include personal details.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
